-- Generated: 2026-07-24
--
-- Scope:
--   * SAFE_EXISTING_UPDATE groups from township-gap-review-triage.gpkg only.
--   * 46 existing township rows; no inserts, deletes, renames, or metadata changes.
--   * Each group reranks current spatial recipients and recomputes its live patch.
--   * Each live patch is capped by both its MIMU township and approved SAFE group.
--   * Each state/region batch is independently transactional and contains <=25 rows.
